      "source": "Qualifier annotation for a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/task/TaskExecutor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.task\"><code>TaskExecutor</code></a> to be injected into Batch\nauto-configuration. Can be used on a secondary task executor source, if there is\nanother one marked as <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/Primary.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>@Primary</code></a>.",
